        head = 0;
    else {
        if (!hpack_dht_defrag(dht))
            return -1;
        wrap = dht->wrap + 1;
        head = dht->head + 1;
        prev = head - 1;
        tail = 0;
    }
}
```

Here, `prev = head = dht->head` (set before the branch). And `dht->front` is unchanged. So `prev == dht->front` if `dht->head == dht->front`.

If `dht->head == dht->front` and `wrap` is incremented (first sub-branch), then `prev == dht->front` is true, and headroom uses `wrap = dht->wrap + 1`.

Now, the headroom is:
```
