```
So:
```
dht->dte[head].addr = dht->dte[dht->front].addr - (name.len + value.len) >= sizeof(*dht) + (dht->wrap+1) * 8
```

So the write starts at `dht->dte[head].addr >= sizeof(*dht) + (dht->wrap+1) * 8`. This is within the DTE array region (after the DTE array). So the write is safe.

